  "scope": "Input to experiment E1. Each rule of the pinned catalog carries one class before any cohort is measured. A class change is a protocol amendment. Roles list where the rule's count enters a prevalence table; string roles stay in a separate layer. Revision 2 (September 11, 2026) admits the specification role beside documentation in every rule that admits documentation; the class of every rule is unchanged.",
